{"id": 108245030, "slug": "wait-and-see", "title": "Wait and See", "subtitle": "The market responds to the Bank Term Funding Program (BTFP)", "post_date": "2023-03-13T22:00:45.732Z", "audience": "everyone", "wordcount": 344, "reaction_count": 0, "comment_count": 2, "restacks": 0, "reactions": {"\u2764": 0}, "body_html": "<p>Today will be a light one.  We\u2019re in reaction mode vs prognostication mode.  </p><p>With one proviso, left over from our time at Lehman shorting banks:</p><div class=\"subscription-widget-wrap-editor\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://www.campbellramble.ai/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe&quot;,&quot;language&quot;:&quot;en&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"SubscribeWidgetToDOM\"><div class=\"subscription-widget show-subscribe\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Thanks for reading Campbell Ramble! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work.</p></div><form class=\"subscription-widget-subscribe\"><input type=\"email\" class=\"email-input\" name=\"email\" placeholder=\"Type your email\u2026\" tabindex=\"-1\"><input type=\"submit\" class=\"button primary\" value=\"Subscribe\"><div class=\"fake-input-wrapper\"><div class=\"fake-input\"></div><div class=\"fake-button\"></div></div></form></div></div><div class=\"pullquote\"><p>Wait until banks stop dying to buy risk.</p></div><p>Tomorrow will be important.  </p><p>In the meantime, here\u2019s some market moves we recommend tracking to get a sense of the potential (and realized) contagion.</p><p>US regional bank equity collapsing.   Many names down 30%+ and trading (temporarily) halted earlier in the day.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!AEoI!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F677bdf14-ae94-4264-82e4-1e077538e4a5_1085x535.png\" data-compo