4\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Nomura calling for 25bps of cuts!</p><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://twitter.com/tolstoybb/status/1635360901967773696?s=20&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;JPM: +25bps\\nGS: no hike\\nBarclays: no hike\\nNomura: -25bps &quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;tolstoybb&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Rachel&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;Mon Mar 13 19:23:17 +0000 2023&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;And we have the first sell-side non-consensus (for now) call:\\n\\nNomura's Amemiya said they changed their Fed call to consider a 25-bps cut (not a hike) at the FOMC meeting next week!&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;aRishisays&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Rishi Mishra&quot;},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:4,&quot;like_count&quot;:58,&quot;impression_count&quot;:0,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:{},&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><div class=\"twitter-embed\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://twitter.com/abcampbell/status/1635359024874127360?s=20&quot;,&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Good. \\n\\nThis is step 4 on our Fed playbook. &quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;abcampbell&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Alexander Campbell&quot;,&quot;profile_image_url&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;date&quot;:&quot;Mon Mar 13 19:15:49 +0000 2023&quot;,&quot;photos&quot;:[],&quot;quoted_tweet&quot;:{&quot;full_text&quot;:&quot;Nomura not only calling for a pause but for a 25bps cut now https://t.co/XIbyF8ToUN&quot;,&quot;username&quot;:&quot;markflowchatter&quot;,&quot;name&quot;:&quot;Marc Lehman&quot;},&quot;reply_count&quot;:0,&quot;retweet_count&quot;:0,&quot;like_count&quot;:4,&quot;impression_count&quot;:0,&quot;expanded_url&quot;:{},&quot;video_url&quot;:null,&quot;video_preview_media_key&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true}\" data-component-name=\"Twitter2ToDOM\"></div><p>Massive moves in rates markets, basically one more hike and then pricing in easing.  Twitter saying forced liquidations, I\u2019m left wondering if maybe the market is right.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ipIO!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fed380ded-c8c3-4efb-9e29-200dea05bbc6_1405x727.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ipIO!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fed380ded-c8c3-4efb-9e29-200dea05bbc6_1405x727.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ipIO!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fed380ded-c8c3-4efb-9e29-200dea05bbc6_1405x727.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ipIO!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fed380ded-c8c3-4efb-9e29-200dea05bbc6_1405x727.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ipIO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fed380ded-c8c3-4efb-9e29-200dea05bbc6_1405x727.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ipIO!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fed380ded-c8c3-4efb-9e29-200dea05bbc6_1405x727.png\" width=\"1405\" height=\"727\" d